# Name: Fractal Carpet
# Summary: Bracketed right-angle branches weave a dense carpet of mirrored corridors and chambers.
# Visualizer: turtle_2d
# Angle: 90
# Iterations: 3
# Max Iterations: 7
# Initial Color: 9

